OL,4,CCouncillor quits group over junior     
OL,5,Cschool move                            
OL,6,GA councillor has quit the majority     
OL,7,Ggroup on a council in protest over     
OL,8,Gplans to relocate a junior school.     
OL,10,FMark Johnston resigned from the        
OL,11,FLiberal Democrat group on East Surrey  
OL,12,FCouncil (ESC) after its cabinet        
OL,13,Fapproved the move of Reigate Priory    
OL,14,FJunior School to Woodhatch Place.      
OL,16,FThe decision was taken last month      
OL,17,Fafter a debate in which cabinet        
OL,18,Fmembers raised concerns about the      
OL,19,Fimpact on traffic and the future of    
OL,20,Fthe school's current Grade I listed    
OL,21,Fsite.                                  
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
