OL,4,CFamily of woman seek answers after     
OL,5,CTrinidad death                         
OL,6,GThe family of a former Kent pub        
OL,7,Glandlord who was shot and killed in    
OL,8,GTrinidad and Tobago say they are       
OL,9,Gcontinuing to seek answers after       
OL,10,Ginvestigations into her death stalled. 
OL,12,FElaine McGowan, 65, died in the        
OL,13,FCaribbean country in July having moved 
OL,14,Fto the country after running The       
OL,15,FCastle Hotel in Saltwood, Hythe.       
OL,17,FHer sister, Joanne Butcher, told BBC   
OL,18,FSouth East that despite an initially   
OL,19,Fthorough investigation, efforts to     
OL,20,Ffind out what happened have proved     
OL,21,Ffruitless.                             
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
