OL,4,CSouth East Water appoints new non-     
OL,5,Cexecutive chair                        
OL,6,GSouth East Water (SEW) has appointed a 
OL,7,Gnew independent non-executive chair as 
OL,8,Git looks to rebuild trust with         
OL,9,Gcustomers.                             
OL,11,FThe firm said Richard Morse would      
OL,12,Fbring more than 40 years of experience 
OL,13,Fin infrastructure, investment and      
OL,14,Fregulation to the role when he started 
OL,15,Fon 3 December.                         
OL,17,FSEW boss John Halsall pledged to make  
OL,18,Fchanges to improve the company when he 
OL,19,Fjoined in July, but a report from      
OL,20,Fregulators in October said SEW was the 
OL,21,Fworst in the industry for supply       
OL,22,Fissues.                           G4/4 
